{
  "abstract": "Lean 4 formalization of all three clauses of Paper C, Theorem 1.2. Clause (i) proves a total-variation Poisson approximation uniformly over every deterministic mask of the dyadic block. Clause (ii) gives the Laplace-functional characterization of the limiting spatial Poisson point process. Clause (iii) gives the corresponding marked characterization together with uniform tightness of the discrete marks. All three compared statements are conditional on exactly three fully stated ordinary propositions specialized from Arratia--Goldstein--Gordon, Evertse--Silverman, and Nicolas--Robin. Those propositions are theorem arguments, not Lean axioms.",
